sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Client (GUI)
    participant Core as ExpenseCoreService
    participant Rules as RuleEngine
    participant FS as FileSystemManager
    participant DB as MetadataRepository

    Note over UI, Core: Utente carica un file (es. Scontrino)

    UI->>Core: uploadDocument(entryID, DocType.RECEIPT, byte[])
    activate Core

    Core->>DB: findById(entryID)
    DB-->>Core: ExpenseEntry (Path: .../2024-10-21_Farmacia/)

    Note right of Core: 1. Core chiede il nome file standard
    Core->>Rules: getNamingConvention(DocType.RECEIPT)
    Rules-->>Core: "Scontrino.pdf"

    Note right of Core: 2. Scrittura su Raspberry
    Core->>FS: saveFile(".../Farmacia/", "Scontrino.pdf", byte[])
    FS-->>Core: Success

    Note right of Core: 3. Aggiornamento Slot
    Core->>Core: entry.getSlot(RECEIPT).setFile(metadata)
    Core->>DB: save(entry)

    Note right of Core: 4. Ricalcolo Stato (Rule Engine)
    Core->>Rules: validate(entry)
    alt Missing Mandatory Docs
        Rules-->>Core: Result(PARTIAL, missing: INVOICE)
        Core->>DB: updateStatus(PARTIAL)
    else All Mandatory Present
        Rules-->>Core: Result(COMPLIANT)
        Core->>DB: updateStatus(COMPLIANT)
    end

    Core-->>UI: UploadSuccessDTO (NewStatus)
    deactivate Core